# Google service-account private keys — never commit these.
#
# Matched by pattern rather than by exact name, because Google's download names
# the file <project-id>-<key-id>.json, which none of the exact rules below would
# have caught. A key has already been published from this repository once; the
# rules that let it through were rules that needed the filename guessed in
# advance.
service-account.json
google-service-account.json
*-service-account.json
*service*account*.json
*service*account*.pem
secrets/
credentials/
*.p12
*-key.json

# Every env file except the committed example.
.env*
!.env.example

*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts
.DS_Store
